# HyperMOS / TNM hosts integration.
# Fail-safe by design: if the data file does not exist, the bind mount fails
# and Android continues booting with the stock /system/etc/hosts.
#
# TNM creates and updates /data/system/tnm/hosts in-place. Because init creates
# the bind mount before zygote/app mount namespaces are spawned, all normal app
# processes inherit the same hosts view without Magisk/KernelSU modules.

on post-fs-data
    mkdir /data/system/tnm 0755 root root
    mount none /data/system/tnm/hosts /system/etc/hosts bind
